    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take to the skies in <strong>Flycremental</strong>, the ultimate <strong>incremental sky-runner</strong> where <strong>your upgrades actually matter</strong>. Strap yourself into a rickety, rune-etched sky-cart and blast off, weaving between medieval villages, ancient runes, and gorgeous landscapes, then inevitably die. Horribly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge Your Own Path</strong><br>Tired of incremental games forcing you to upgrade everything? Let's break that pattern, and the game! Here's some of the things you'll be able to turn yourself into in Flycremental:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mobile Air Fortress</strong>: Stack Health, Shields, and build a repair-bot to become nearly indestructible. Laugh in the face of obstacles as you steamroll through them, and enemies!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Phantom Racer</strong>: Invest in suspension, bounce-boost off the ground, and go for precision steering to zip through the sky at highly impractical (but funny) speeds. Outmaneuver obstacles and ghost past enemies with ease.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcane Arsenal</strong>: Channel raw mana into fireballs, homing rockets, and critical-hit amplifiers. Obliterate everything in your path, turning everyone silly enough to stand in your way into fireworks!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill Meets Strategy</strong><br>Flycremental isn\u2019t just about numbers: the tight flying controls make it a super satisfying game loop to ultimately dominate with insane upgrades. I make it, you break it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies get more aggressive as they get closer, which is dangerous... for them as well! Bait them into obstacles, projectiles or each other and loot those sweet sweet crystals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Actual Replayability</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural Sky Chunks</strong>: No two runs are the same. Randomized layouts, destructible scenery, and secret pickups keep you exploring.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short, Satisfying Runs</strong>: You're going to die, a lot! And that's okay, because you'll just return to your workshop with more resources to spend.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strap in, Wizard-pilot: the clouds await!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take to the skies in <strong>Flycremental</strong>, the ultimate <strong>incremental sky-runner</strong> where <strong>your upgrades actually matter</strong>. Strap yourself into a rickety, rune-etched sky-cart and blast off, weaving between medieval villages, ancient runes, and gorgeous landscapes, then inevitably die. Horribly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge Your Own Path</strong><br>Tired of incremental games forcing you to upgrade everything? Let's break that pattern, and the game! Here's some of the things you'll be able to turn yourself into in Flycremental:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mobile Air Fortress</strong>: Stack Health, Shields, and build a repair-bot to become nearly indestructible. Laugh in the face of obstacles as you steamroll through them, and enemies!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Phantom Racer</strong>: Invest in suspension, bounce-boost off the ground, and go for precision steering to zip through the sky at highly impractical (but funny) speeds. Outmaneuver obstacles and ghost past enemies with ease.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcane Arsenal</strong>: Channel raw mana into fireballs, homing rockets, and critical-hit amplifiers. Obliterate everything in your path, turning everyone silly enough to stand in your way into fireworks!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill Meets Strategy</strong><br>Flycremental isn\u2019t just about numbers: the tight flying controls make it a super satisfying game loop to ultimately dominate with insane upgrades. I make it, you break it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies get more aggressive as they get closer, which is dangerous... for them as well! Bait them into obstacles, projectiles or each other and loot those sweet sweet crystals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Actual Replayability</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural Sky Chunks</strong>: No two runs are the same. Randomized layouts, destructible scenery, and secret pickups keep you exploring.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short, Satisfying Runs</strong>: You're going to die, a lot! And that's okay, because you'll just return to your workshop with more resources to spend.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strap in, Wizard-pilot: the clouds await!</p>",
